\title{Kei Irie，Strong Closing Lemmas in Hamiltonian Dynamics}
\date{2026-10-16}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Kei Irie，Strong Closing Lemmas in Hamiltonian Dynamics，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，Volume 4，Invited Lectures (Sections 5–8)，179–198。DOI [10.1137/25M1805400](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1805400)。[SIAM 正式全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/full/10.1137/25M1805400)。}
\p{原文版权为 © 2026 International Mathematical Union，由 SIAM 按 [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 发布。相应中文笔记采用改编叙述，并加入局部计算与前置证明。}
\p{三维闭合与谱输入见 §§3.1–3.3、4.1、5.1–5.2；曲面映射见 §§3.4、4.2、5.5；初等容量见 §§5.3–5.4；等分布见 §6；高维范围与近周期系统见 §7。§8 讨论极小超曲面的类比。}
\p{基础研究文献包括 Irie，Dense existence of periodic Reeb orbits and ECH spectral invariants，J. Mod. Dyn. 9 (2015)，357–363，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.3934/jmd.2015.9.357)；Hutchings，An elementary alternative to ECH capacities，PNAS 119 (2022)，e2203090119，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2203090119)。}
\p{任意维椭球的结论见 Chaidez、Datta、Prasad、Tanny，Contact homology and higher dimensional closing lemmas，J. Mod. Dyn. 20 (2024)，67–153，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.3934/jmd.2024003)。一般近周期形式的带条件推广见 Chaidez–Tanny，Elementary SFT Spectral Gaps and the Strong Closing Property，[arXiv:2312.17211v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.17211v1)，Assumption 1.3、Theorems 5、7。}
\p{谱刚性映射的闭合见 Çineli–Seyfaddini，The strong closing lemma and Hamiltonian pseudo-rotations，J. Mod. Dyn. 20 (2024)，299–318，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.3934/jmd.2024008)；[arXiv:2210.00771v2](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.00771v2)，Theorem 1、§§3–5。Irie §7.1 的高维容量结果将详细证明指向其筹备中的 Elementary capacities and spectral invariants in high dimensions。}
\p{Darboux 局部定理参见 Ana Cannas da Silva，Lectures on Symplectic Geometry，Lecture Notes in Mathematics 1764，Springer，2001，2008 修订版，Theorem 8.1，[作者公开讲义](https://www.math.ist.utl.pt/~acannas/Books/symplectic.pdf)。}
\p{体积谱及极小超曲面应用参见 Liokumovich–Marques–Neves，Weyl law for the volume spectrum，Ann. of Math. 187 (2018)，933–961，Theorem 1.1，[全文](https://annals.math.princeton.edu/wp-content/uploads/annals-v187-n3-p07-p.pdf)；Irie–Marques–Neves，Density of minimal hypersurfaces for generic metrics，同卷，963–972，§§2–3，[全文](https://annals.math.princeton.edu/wp-content/uploads/annals-v187-n3-p08-p.pdf)。度量按正定二次型约定时，宽度在 #{g\mapsto c g} 下乘 #{c^{(\dim M-1)/2}}；这与 Irie–Marques–Neves 的 Lemma 2.1 中度量比较估计的指数一致。}
